**Mode**: adversarial, Option B independent review

## Verdict

**Verdict**: PASS

At iteration 9, after a VETO at iteration 3 recorded as ledger entry #750.

## Reviewer capability disclosure

The independent architecture reviewer held Read, Grep and Glob only for the
entire review and disclosed that limit beside every finding, labelling
existence-only findings as unsized. It executed nothing. Every quoted probe
output in the plan was produced by the Judge against the repository copy of the
module, not the installed copy.

